  "content": {
    "paragraphs": [
      {
        "id": "p1",
        "order": 1,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s1",
            "text": "In 2001, I was part of an expedition to explore the Titanic."
          },
          {
            "id": "s2",
            "text": "Our team used two small deep-sea robots, one blue and one green."
          },
          {
            "id": "s3",
            "text": "My job was to make sure the robots’ batteries worked well."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p2",
        "order": 2,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s4",
            "text": "Three days into the expedition, the green robot got stuck inside the Titanic."
          },
          {
            "id": "s5",
            "text": "Even worse, one of its batteries was damaged."
          },
          {
            "id": "s6",
            "text": "That was dangerous, as the battery could explode."
          },
          {
            "id": "s7",
            "text": "It could harm the robot and the ship."
          },
          {
            "id": "s8",
            "text": "We had to find a way to get it out."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p3",
        "order": 3,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s9",
            "text": "In the middle of the ocean, though, there are no stores to buy supplies."
          },
          {
            "id": "s10",
            "text": "So, we had an idea."
          },
          {
            "id": "s11",
            "text": "We took a coat hanger and put it inside the blue robot."
          },
          {
            "id": "s12",
            "text": "The plan was to use the hanger’s hook to pull out the green robot."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p4",
        "order": 4,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s13",
            "text": "Two crew members and I got ready to go down in a three-man submarine."
          },
          {
            "id": "s14",
            "text": "A crane lifted us and placed us in the water."
          },
          {
            "id": "s15",
            "text": "Then we started to sink—12,500 feet to the ocean bottom."
          },
          {
            "id": "s16",
            "text": "If anything went wrong, we were totally on our own."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p5",
        "order": 5,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s17",
            "text": "At about 9,000 feet, a crewmate accidentally touched some wires."
          },
          {
            "id": "s18",
            "text": "Suddenly, all the sub’s lights went out."
          },
          {
            "id": "s19",
            "text": "We were in complete darkness."
          },
          {
            "id": "s20",
            "text": "It was terrifying, but the pilot was able to fix it, and we carried on."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p6",
        "order": 6,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s21",
            "text": "Finally, we reached the Titanic’ s wreckage."
          },
          {
            "id": "s22",
            "text": "First, we could just see pieces of metal."
          },
          {
            "id": "s23",
            "text": "Then we started to see suitcases and shoes."
          },
          {
            "id": "s24",
            "text": "Over a thousand people fell here, but their bodies disappeared long ago."
          }
        ]
      },
      {
        "id": "p7",
        "order": 7,
        "sentences": [
          {
            "id": "s25",
            "text": "For about 12 hours, we tried to pull the robot out with the coat hanger."
          },
          {
            "id": "s26",
            "text": "Finally, we got it and brought it to the surface."
          },
          {
            "id": "s27",
            "text": "There was no way we were going to leave it behind."
          },
          {
            "id": "s28",
            "text": "That little robot was part of our team."
          }
        ]
      }
    ]
  },
